    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 30,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The encoding is complete,\"",
        "line": 33
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 31,
      "actor": "Torrhen",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Deep Waters sing eternal songs,\"",
        "line": 34
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 37,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The convergences of Year 3,500 approach,\"",
        "line": 40
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 39,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"*And individual teachers serve by demonstratingthat consciousness evolution never ends,*\"",
        "line": 42
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 43,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The students who will come,\"",
        "line": 46
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 45,
      "actor": "Torrhen",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This is what freedom becomes when it learns to serve evolution rather than individual escape,\"",
        "line": 48
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 49,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We have become what teaching was always pointing toward,\"",
        "line": 52
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 51,
      "actor": "Torrhen",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And in serving universal education, we discover what individual identity becomes when it serves purposes larger than itself,\"",
        "line": 54
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 55,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The children are ready,\"",
        "line": 58
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 57,
      "actor": "Torrhen",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Born already prepared for convergences that will require consciousness evolution beyond our current comprehension,\"",
        "line": 60
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 58,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then our work approaches completion,\"",
        "line": 61
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 60,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Like the Deep Waters,\"",
        "line": 63
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 66,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The students will find us,\"",
        "line": 69
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 68,
      "actor": "Torrhen",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And we will continue learning,\"",
        "line": 71
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 72,
      "actor": "they",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The First Tongue lives,\"",
        "line": 75
      }
    }
  ],
